  "description": "<p>Fly your flag high and show your American spirit with our Freedom US Flag Hoodie! This patriotic sweatshirt features a graphic design on the front with bold lettering containing a distressed American flag inside. Without a doubt, this hooded military sweatshirt will become part of your go-to wardrobe. They&rsquo;re great for working outside, chilling around the campfire, traveling around, and other various activities! Warm &amp; Comfortable: Crafted from a pill-resistant cotton / polyester fabric blend that is breathable and soft to the touch, the printed hoodie provides all-day comfort and warmth, especially in the spring, fall, and winter. The American flag sweatshirt features a double-layer string hood. Utility at the Forefront: The graphic hooded sweatshirt features a front kangaroo pocket for additional storage and warming your hands. The elastic ribbed cuffs and waist conform to your body without restricting your movement while keeping the heat in and the cold out. Perfect Fit for Everyone: Whether you are traveling, working out, or lounging around, these hooded sweatshirts fit great, providing all-day comfort. These patriotic hoodies are perfect for camping, hiking, jogging, traveling, sports, gym, everyday wear, and more. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Pair your rugged military hoodie with one of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Fatigue Pants.</p>",
